  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\mathrm{X} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Y} & \\mathrm{k}_1=1 \\\\\n\\mathrm{Y} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Z} & \\mathrm{k}_2=2 \\\\\n\\mathrm{Z} \\rightleftharpoons \\omega & \\mathrm{k}_3=4 \\\\\n\\mathrm{X} \\rightleftharpoons \\omega & \\mathrm{k}_1 \\cdot \\mathrm{k}_2 \\cdot \\mathrm{k}_3 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{k}=1 \\times 2 \\times 4 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{k}=8\n\\end{array}$",
